pages['index.html']=('A curious mind. A purposeful life.','A liberal-arts education that moves with you.', '''<section class="intro" data-section="institutional-introduction"><p class="eyebrow">Redbrook College • A fictional learning community</p><h2>Find your people. Follow your questions.</h2><p class="lead">Bring your interests together in a place where conversation turns into discovery, and discovery becomes work that matters.</p><a class="button" href="programs.html">Explore your possibilities</a></section><section class="split" data-section="mentoring-feature"><img src="assets/fieldwork.svg" alt="Original illustration of a student beside a woodland stream"><div><p class="eyebrow">Known. Challenged. Supported.</p><h2>Big questions begin with close connections.</h2><p>Read closely, test an idea, and work alongside faculty who make room for your perspective. Learning crosses the classroom door.</p><a href="biology.html">Explore biology →</a></div></section><section class="band" data-section="place-feature"><h2>A small town. An open horizon.</h2><p>Campus paths connect a historic town center, green spaces and places to make art. Find a setting for your next chapter.</p><a href="visit.html">Get to know Redbrook →</a></section><section data-section="featured-news"><h2>Featured news</h2>'''+cards([('Discovery','Listening to the stream','A student field notebook opens a conversation about local waterways.','news.html#stream','Read the story'),('Community','A table for new ideas','Students share projects at the autumn community gathering.','news.html#table','See the gathering'),('Creativity','Making room for art','An open studio invites the campus to try a new material.','news.html#art','Explore the studio')])+'''</section><section class="band dark" data-section="inclusion-feature"><h2>You belong in the conversation.</h2><p>Curiosity grows when different experiences meet. We make space for listening, participation and thoughtful disagreement.</p><a href="admissions.html">Discover our community →</a></section>''')
